# Recommended local configuration for Supabase.
#
# This file overrides `.env` (Vite loads `.env.local` last), which is why the
# entries below stay commented out until you fill them in: an empty override
# would otherwise hide real values sitting in `.env`.
#
# To connect the app:
#
#   1. Open your Supabase dashboard -> Project Settings -> API.
#   2. Copy the Project URL and the PUBLIC anon / publishable key.
#   3. Uncomment the two lines below and paste the values.
#   4. Restart the dev server:  Ctrl + C, then  npm run dev
#      (Vite only reads environment variables when the server starts.)
#
# Use the anon/publishable key ONLY. The service-role key must never be placed
# in this file, in React code, or in anything committed to GitHub.
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL= https://wftnjveruhjrcvagjafq.supabase.co/rest/v1/
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY= eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6IndmdG5qdmVydWhqcmN2YWdqYWZxIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3OTEzNjE1MTEsImV4cCI6MjEwNjkzNzUxMX0.f6JL-_Was0oXzEIxkBjtUP6l0zclA50fyoW8KDnV6-4
